# Regenerable single-file build (merges index.html+style.css+fonts.css+data.js+app.js).
# Not needed for hosting; only build this on demand if you want to send one .html
# file somewhere (e.g. over WhatsApp) instead of pointing people at the hosted URL.
mushaf-hifz-offline.html

# Downloaded/extracted upstream dataset cache used by build/build_data.py — large,
# regenerated automatically on the next build run, not needed in the repo.
build/_work/
